# ─── GitHub ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get token: https://github.com/settings/tokens
# Required scopes: repo, read:org, read:user
# Avoids rate limiting (60 → 5000 requests/hour)
# export GITHUB_TOKEN=""

